  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Shang Yan Fei uses gourmet food box Gu to keep the righteous path army fed, the clan leaders of Southern Border super forces including Yi clan, Luo clan, Yao clan, and Xia clan join that seventh wave of fighting.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leaders-battlefield-appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_yan_fei",
        "gu_gourmet_food_box_gu",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_yi_clan",
        "fac_yao_clan",
        "fac_xia_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A righteous path Gu Immortal from Luo clan leads the lone cultivator Jiao Lei Zi into the defensive Gu formation, telling him to enter as a Luo clan member bringing an Immortal Gu. Southern Border’s righteous path has thirteen super forces with territories across the region, and Luo clan is one of them.",
      "chapters": [
        1213
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "super-force-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The righteous path lost many members exploring the giant dream realm, including rank seven experts holding great authority. Luo clan lost their third supreme elder. At the formation, Ba Quan Feng contrasts Luo clan’s two Gu Immortals, who bring people with good reputations and clean records, with Qiao clan’s greedier traffic.",
      "chapters": [
        1214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-exploration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ba_quan_feng",
        "fac_qiao_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the banquet Luo clan had invited Chi Shang to, a Luo clan Gu Immortal openly praises Chi Shang’s formation path gift. The same Gu Immortal adds that he would be content if Luo clan produced one or two geniuses holding twenty or thirty percent of that gift.",
      "chapters": [
        1328
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "praise-for-chi-shangs-talent",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chi_shang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yi Hai also sends Luo clan a letter, and Luo clan makes its own movements alongside Tie clan and Yi clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1348
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "letter-and-movement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s righteous path has thirteen super clans, and Luo clan is named in that list with Wu, Ba, Shang, Tie, Hou, Qiao, Chai, Xia, Yi, Chi, Yang, and Yao.",
      "chapters": [
        1610
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "super-clan-list",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
